# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Large / generated files - do NOT commit these directly to a normal git
# repo. See README.md "Sharing your trained model" section for how to
# distribute checkpoints to teammates or judges instead (GitHub Release,
# Git LFS, or a cloud link).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
checkpoints/*.pth
checkpoints/*.onnx
*.pt
*.onnx

# Dataset - large and/or not yours to redistribute. Link its source in
# the README instead of committing it.
VARG_Dataset/

